/* Gp072 - ShapeFix_Edge.FixAddPCurve B-spline projection failure
 * Defect: B-spline 3D curve doesn't lie on host plane; FixAddPCurve projection
 * produces geometrically incorrect pcurve that's "good enough" by tolerance */
